{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50161","headline":"赠皇甫侍御赴都（其二） · 元希声","name":"赠皇甫侍御赴都（其二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"猗嗟衆珍，以况君子。\n公侯之胄，必复其始。\n香器长材，温仪峻峙。\n显此元明，於斯备矣。\n（按此诗凡八首，已载《全唐诗》。\n惟「其二」缺末两句，故依《珠英集》补全之。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元希声","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}